  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Global Support Facility for Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The present project consists of setting up and running a global NDC Support Facility to contribute to accelerate the transition towards low-carbon, resource efficient and resilient economies in line with the EU Green Deal, the Paris Agreement, the Sendai Framework on Disaster Risk Reduction (DRR) and the Sustainable Development Goals.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
